                    "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "In a function that pages its own list, the footer's right side names the function and the page in view, in place of the bank. In Sessions it reads \"Sessions \u00b7 Page 2\" where 01 reads \"Tracks \u00b7 Bank A\". Sessions is the only such function so far. The page is the one the Sessions face shows on the main screen (page 19): Bank turns it, and the footer follows. The rest of the readout is drawn as in any other function."
              }
            ],
